  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Communication &amp; Visibility Plant Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall objective of the present contract is to enhance the tripartite partnership between the Tanzania, EU and the UN system in development cooperation related to compliance with international standards for food safety and export for both internal and external consumption and trade.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;Specific objective(s)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The specific objective of the present contract is to ensure effective communication and visibility on the impact of EU&apos;s support to food safety sector through:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;- &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Strategic guidance and support in setting up and keeping the Plant Health project communication strategy. Enhanced integration of communication in all stages of the project cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;-&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Increase effective communication and visibility of the EU as a key partner and global player, and to improve understanding of EU cooperation and policies in the food safety sector mainly in Tanzania but also in the EAC region at large.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Harmonisation of communication expressions and platforms used to promote the programme in Tanzania and among stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
